1
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:29,400
Mr. Heying,

2
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,600
what do you need me for?

3
00:00:33,840 --> 00:00:34,480
Xiao Qi,

4
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:38,560
that day,

5
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:40,860
what you told me on the rooftop...

6
00:00:41,440 --> 00:00:42,120
I'm sorry.

7
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,620
I didn't react at the time.

8
00:00:46,200 --> 00:00:47,800
I realized in hindsight

9
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:50,690
that you were confessing your feelings to me.

10
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:52,720
But Xiao Qi,

11
00:00:53,120 --> 00:00:54,050
I want to ask you,

12
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:56,600
are you sure you really like me?

13
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:57,200
Of course,

14
00:00:57,880 --> 00:00:58,720
Mr. Heying.

15
00:01:00,240 --> 00:01:01,200
In my heart,

16
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,040
you are the most excellent,

17
00:01:02,040 --> 00:01:02,800
the most perfect,

18
00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,200
and the absolute best person.

19
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,260
Please believe me.

20
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:07,480
Xiao Qi,

21
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,260
it's not that I don't believe you.

22
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,280
I just feel

23
00:01:13,039 --> 00:01:14,970
you haven't figured yourself out.

24
00:01:16,680 --> 00:01:17,720
True liking

25
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:20,380
isn't thinking someone is flawless,

26
00:01:20,680 --> 00:01:22,410
but after you see this person's

27
00:01:22,560 --> 00:01:23,600
vulnerabilities,

28
00:01:23,600 --> 00:01:24,120
flaws,

29
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:26,320
and even their dark side,

30
00:01:26,680 --> 00:01:29,080
you still feel strongly attracted to them.

31
00:01:29,720 --> 00:01:30,280
But

32
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:32,080
I don't think you are vulnerable,

33
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:32,960
or flawed,

34
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,020
or have a dark side.

35
00:01:34,759 --> 00:01:37,160
You were forced by Jinxi to shoot that short drama.

36
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,039
It wasn't your fault.

37
00:01:38,039 --> 00:01:38,479
No.

38
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:39,920
I do.

39
00:01:40,479 --> 00:01:41,360
I have so many.

40
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,800
You just haven't noticed them,

41
00:01:43,800 --> 00:01:45,720
or perhaps you're unwilling to.

42
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:50,400
You are just projecting an ideal partner

43
00:01:50,400 --> 00:01:51,840
onto me.

44
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:53,539
This isn't liking,

45
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,600
and it certainly isn't love.

46
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,200
Xiao Qi,

47
00:01:57,640 --> 00:01:58,900
I believe that one day,

48
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,410
you will definitely understand this.

49
00:02:02,800 --> 00:02:05,200
Isn't this liking?

50
00:02:05,720 --> 00:02:06,450
Don't worry.

51
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:09,199
I will always be your Mr. Heying.

52
00:02:09,759 --> 00:02:10,759
But I really think

53
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:13,180
you deserve to experience true love.

54
00:02:13,920 --> 00:02:15,240
A love of mutual discovery

55
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,770
and mutual understanding.

56
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:20,680
I will accompany you through this confusing stage

57
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,160
until you truly let go.

58
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,560
Okay?

59
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,760
Thank you,

60
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:26,840
Mr. Heying.

61
00:02:42,160 --> 00:02:46,160
Longing finally turns into a flush of rouge.

62
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:49,600
Tossing and turning a thousand times,

63
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:52,920
just for this moment of facing each other.

64
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:55,720
Across mountains and rivers,

65
00:02:56,600 --> 00:02:58,360
you are by my side.

66
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:05,360
Stop.

67
00:03:08,040 --> 00:03:08,640
Jinxi,

68
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:10,100
what are you doing?

69
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:10,880
I'm

70
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:11,720
kissing.

71
00:03:12,480 --> 00:03:13,480
Did you even kiss?

72
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:14,280
No.

73
00:03:14,280 --> 00:03:15,480
Can't we just fake it?

74
00:03:17,880 --> 00:03:18,800
This scene

75
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:22,130
is a love-pledging scene for Ning Caichen and Nie Xiaoqian.

76
00:03:22,800 --> 00:03:24,560
What I need is authenticity

77
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,480
to push the whole plot to its climax.

78
00:03:26,480 --> 00:03:27,210
Understand?

79
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,290
Understood.

80
00:03:29,800 --> 00:03:30,660
Let's go again.

81
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:32,320
Ready.

82
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,200
Director, I have an idea.

83
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:42,360
What is it now?

84
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:42,880
Can we,

85
00:03:42,880 --> 00:03:45,160
when our lips are very, very close to each other,

86
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,320
use visual effects

87
00:03:46,320 --> 00:03:48,000
to make it look like we're kissing?

88
00:03:48,000 --> 00:03:49,120
What do you think?

89
00:03:50,440 --> 00:03:51,600
This is a musical.

90
00:03:52,240 --> 00:03:53,900
There is no post-production.

91
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:54,880
Yes.

92
00:03:54,920 --> 00:03:55,920
A stage play.

93
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:57,200
Go on.

94
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:02,440
Across mountains and rivers,

95
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:05,080
you are with me.

96
00:04:09,400 --> 00:04:11,260
Director, I have another method.

97
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:15,560
Jin Xi,

98
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:17,480
what exactly do you want to do?

99
00:04:17,480 --> 00:04:19,740
I have two other ways to make it look real.

100
00:04:24,760 --> 00:04:25,560
The first method

101
00:04:25,560 --> 00:04:26,560
is to use my thumb,

102
00:04:27,040 --> 00:04:28,640
placing it against his lips.

103
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:31,300
It looks very real when I kiss it like this. Look.

104
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:32,409
How is it?

105
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,880
Or the second method,

106
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:36,540
using tape.

107
00:04:39,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Stick the tape

108
00:04:40,200 --> 00:04:41,159
on my mouth.

109
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,000
Alright, alright.

110
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:42,930
Stop doing that.

111
00:04:44,280 --> 00:04:45,810
Take the tape and step down.

112
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:49,600
Jinxi.

113
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,640
What I need is not for you, Jinxi,

114
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:52,700
to kiss Bai Feixin.

115
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:55,600
What I need is Ning Caichen with love,

116
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,800
to kiss Nie Xiaoqian.

117
00:04:57,600 --> 00:05:00,200
Can you show some professionalism as an actor?

118
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:03,160
Director,

119
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:05,080
I still don't quite understand.

120
00:05:08,160 --> 00:05:08,760
Heying.

121
00:05:28,360 --> 00:05:29,160
Did you get it?

122
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:31,530
Understood.

123
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,400
Come.

124
00:05:33,120 --> 00:05:33,780
Do it again.

125
00:05:36,600 --> 00:05:37,659
Thank you, Heying.

126
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:46,720
Start.

127
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:50,800
Across mountains and rivers,

128
00:05:51,680 --> 00:05:53,280
you are with me.

129
00:06:06,160 --> 00:06:06,760
Director.

130
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,560
What's wrong with you now?

131
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:12,200
How can I kiss him when he looks like that?

132
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:13,840
Am I really that hard to kiss?

133
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,240
No one has ever treated me like this before.

134
00:06:15,240 --> 00:06:15,680
I need to...

135
00:06:15,680 --> 00:06:17,000
calm down a bit.

136
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,040
Five-minute break.

137
00:06:21,040 --> 00:06:22,300
Treating me like this,

138
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:24,400
is just too much.

139
00:06:40,080 --> 00:06:41,480
Then there's no problem.

140
00:06:52,880 --> 00:06:53,760
Why?

141
00:06:56,400 --> 00:06:56,960
Why

142
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:59,360
don't I pull away when you kiss me,

143
00:06:59,720 --> 00:07:01,520
but you pull away when I kiss you?

144
00:07:01,920 --> 00:07:03,480
Should I be more assertive?

145
00:07:24,560 --> 00:07:25,120
What?

146
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,980
His leg is injured.

147
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:29,490
That's how it is.

148
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,800
Jin Xi had spasms due to a muscle contusion in his leg.

149
00:07:32,800 --> 00:07:34,530
He needs to rest for three days.

150
00:07:35,280 --> 00:07:38,409
Is it that stressful to rehearse a kissing scene with me?

151
00:07:38,560 --> 00:07:39,600
It's not your fault.

152
00:07:39,600 --> 00:07:40,040
Don't overthink it.

153
00:07:40,040 --> 00:07:41,159
Jin Xi is injured.

154
00:07:41,159 --> 00:07:42,840
How about each of us buys a bouquet of flowers

155
00:07:42,840 --> 00:07:44,040
to go and comfort him?

156
00:07:44,720 --> 00:07:45,720
I think that works.

157
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,000
Then let's each write him a blessing.

158
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:48,960
Sure.

159
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:49,890
We must write it.

160
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:53,280
When did you guys get so close to him?

161
00:07:53,400 --> 00:07:54,000
Director.

162
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:57,100
Jin Xi has always had a good relationship with all of us.

163
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,400
He is very nice

164
00:07:58,680 --> 00:08:00,340
and often treats us to snacks.

165
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:01,840
Two, three.

166
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:04,160
Come, I'll treat everyone to donuts.

167
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,560
Thank you,

168
00:08:05,560 --> 00:08:06,240
Jin Xi.

169
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,320
Help yourselves.

170
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:09,040
Thanks, Jin Xi.

171
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:12,280
Feixin even got fat from eating his donuts.

172
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:15,930
He's very funny.

173
00:08:17,440 --> 00:08:18,440
Do you still remember

174
00:08:18,440 --> 00:08:20,160
that groundhog joke?

175
00:08:21,840 --> 00:08:22,240
And

176
00:08:22,480 --> 00:08:24,960
the cheesy pickup lines he taught me.

177
00:08:26,800 --> 00:08:27,200
And

178
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:28,400
his practical jokes.

179
00:08:28,400 --> 00:08:30,800
Director, didn't you always say we were off-stage?

180
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:32,960
Then he secretly moved the floor mats in the rehearsal hall

181
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:34,559
20 centimeters to the right.

182
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,440
What?

183
00:08:38,559 --> 00:08:39,760
He did it.

184
00:08:42,760 --> 00:08:44,760
I told you I didn't stick it crooked.

185
00:08:45,080 --> 00:08:47,140
It made the director scold me all day.

186
00:08:48,680 --> 00:08:49,560
Xiaoqi.

187
00:08:50,440 --> 00:08:51,160
I'm sorry.

188
00:08:51,680 --> 00:08:52,880
I misunderstood you.

189
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:53,800
Director,

190
00:08:54,320 --> 00:08:55,560
when you were away,

191
00:08:56,120 --> 00:08:58,000
he often took us to play Werewolf.

192
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,040
What?

193
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:07,480
You all went.

194
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,560
Heying,

195
00:09:13,120 --> 00:09:14,580
you didn't go too, did you?

196
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,120
He had the most fun.

197
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:18,120
What do you mean I had the most fun?

198
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,880
I got killed on the first night every time.

199
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:21,360
It was obviously Bai Feixin who had the most fun.

200
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:22,680
How did I have the most fun?

201
00:09:22,680 --> 00:09:23,400
Wasn't it?

202
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,560
You were all dead,

203
00:09:26,560 --> 00:09:27,880
and I was the werewolf.

204
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:28,800
Wang Jianshe.

205
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:29,560
Director, let me tell you.

206
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:30,880
When Jinxi took us to the club last time,

207
00:09:30,880 --> 00:09:32,200
he was the one who had the most fun.

208
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,800
Why am I the one having the most fun again?

209
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,200
Obviously, Jiao Ye had the most fun.

210
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:35,800
What?

211
00:09:42,200 --> 00:09:44,720
When did you guys go clubbing?

212
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,280
We're doomed.

213
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:48,740
This...

214
00:09:48,920 --> 00:09:49,680
Baby.

215
00:09:50,560 --> 00:09:51,600
Let me explain.

216
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:52,880
On the seventh,

217
00:09:53,280 --> 00:09:54,880
weren't you feeling unwell?

218
00:09:55,040 --> 00:09:57,040
Didn't you say you went to rehearse?

219
00:09:57,600 --> 00:09:58,600
Baby, let me explain.

220
00:09:58,600 --> 00:10:00,480
Which leg did Jinxi injure?

221
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,920
I'll go break his other leg right now.

222
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:04,160
Director,

223
00:10:04,160 --> 00:10:05,960
I have so many things to tell you.

224
00:10:07,440 --> 00:10:08,880
Talking about Jin Xi,

225
00:10:14,400 --> 00:10:15,260
It still hurts.

226
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:16,720
What should we do?

227
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:18,760
Who is it?

228
00:10:20,120 --> 00:10:20,600
Who?

229
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:21,480
Who is it?

230
00:10:23,720 --> 00:10:24,520
The director.

231
00:10:24,800 --> 00:10:25,040
Bro.

232
00:10:25,040 --> 00:10:25,960
The director is here.

233
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:26,800
The director is here.

234
00:10:26,800 --> 00:10:28,000
Am I interrupting?

235
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:28,480
Director,

236
00:10:28,480 --> 00:10:29,080
please come in.

237
00:10:29,080 --> 00:10:29,560
Quick.

238
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:30,120
Come in quickly.

239
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:30,960
Come in, please.

240
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,560
Director.

241
00:10:31,560 --> 00:10:32,560
Help him sit down.

242
00:10:32,680 --> 00:10:33,120
Stop jumping around.

243
00:10:33,120 --> 00:10:34,120
Why did you get up?

244
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:34,920
Have a seat.

245
00:10:35,560 --> 00:10:36,160
Slow down.

246
00:10:37,360 --> 00:10:39,890
I'm here on everyone's behalf to check on you.

247
00:10:39,960 --> 00:10:40,800
These are flowers.

248
00:10:40,800 --> 00:10:42,000
Such beautiful flowers.

249
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:44,000
And a get-well card.

250
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:45,680
Thank you, Director.

251
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:49,660
Wishing Ms. Jin Xi a speedy recovery.

252
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:07,560
Um, Eason,

253
00:11:08,680 --> 00:11:10,160
is there anything to drink?

254
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,290
We have everything.

255
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:14,040
Do we have lemon juice?

256
00:11:15,600 --> 00:11:16,600
Any herbal tea?

257
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:16,880
Yes.

258
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,200
Any Oldenlandia water?

259
00:11:19,200 --> 00:11:19,640
Yes.

260
00:11:21,960 --> 00:11:23,640
Is the herbal tea sugar-free?

261
00:11:24,560 --> 00:11:25,720
We really don't have this.

262
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,400
Great, I want sugar-free ones.

263
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:28,400
Go buy two sugar-free drinks.

264
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:29,200
I'll go then.

265
00:11:29,200 --> 00:11:30,160
Director, please look after him for me.

266
00:11:30,160 --> 00:11:30,490
Okay.

267
00:11:30,640 --> 00:11:31,500
Alright, go on.

268
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:40,400
Director.

269
00:11:41,080 --> 00:11:41,800
Thank you

270
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:43,810
for coming to see me.

271
00:11:44,160 --> 00:11:46,020
I'm here representing everyone.

272
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,690
Thank you for representing everyone.

273
00:11:52,880 --> 00:11:53,360
How is your leg?

274
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,760
How was rehearsal today?

275
00:11:56,560 --> 00:11:57,040
I...

276
00:11:57,040 --> 00:11:58,040
I'll speak first.

277
00:11:59,000 --> 00:11:59,600
Director,

278
00:11:59,680 --> 00:12:01,080
how was the rehearsal?

279
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,800
The male lead was absent,

280
00:12:02,800 --> 00:12:03,800
what do you think?

281
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:05,890
It was unsatisfactory.

282
00:12:15,360 --> 00:12:16,080
Bro.

283
00:12:19,480 --> 00:12:20,200
Guess what.

284
00:12:20,560 --> 00:12:21,880
The vending machine at the door

285
00:12:21,880 --> 00:12:23,560
happened to have two bottles of sugar-free floral tea,

286
00:12:23,560 --> 00:12:24,820
and I bought them both.

287
00:12:25,560 --> 00:12:26,000
Bro.

288
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:27,760
Director.

289
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:28,400
Thank you.

290
00:12:28,800 --> 00:12:29,730
You're welcome.

291
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,680
I left my sunglasses at the company.

292
00:12:41,680 --> 00:12:43,160
Could you go get them for me?

293
00:12:43,160 --> 00:12:45,200
Why do you need sunglasses at night?

294
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:45,480
I...

295
00:12:45,480 --> 00:12:46,740
just want to wear them.

296
00:12:47,360 --> 00:12:48,160
There are several pairs at home.

297
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,280
I'll get them for you.

298
00:12:49,280 --> 00:12:51,280
That pair fits my face shape.

299
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:52,200
I look good in them.

300
00:12:52,200 --> 00:12:54,080
But your leg is injured like this now.

301
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:55,160
Wearing sunglasses won't help.

302
00:12:55,160 --> 00:12:56,960
Tomorrow I'll wear my sunglasses in the sun

303
00:12:56,960 --> 00:12:57,640
and go train.

304
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,170
Alright.

305
00:13:00,720 --> 00:13:02,050
Take your time, no rush.

306
00:13:05,680 --> 00:13:07,600
So how did you hurt your leg?

307
00:13:10,200 --> 00:13:10,880
I was just

308
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:13,960
practicing that scene,

309
00:13:14,080 --> 00:13:16,000
and accidentally injured my leg.

310
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,730
Practicing what scene?

311
00:13:18,720 --> 00:13:19,780
The kissing scene.

312
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:20,920
With whom?

313
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:22,040
By myself.

314
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,320
Ah, no,

315
00:13:23,560 --> 00:13:24,800
also with your photo.

316
00:13:25,160 --> 00:13:25,720
No,

317
00:13:25,880 --> 00:13:27,560
also with Bai Feixin's photo.

318
00:13:28,600 --> 00:13:31,360
It's the three of us together,

319
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:31,920
just...

320
00:13:31,920 --> 00:13:32,400
Alright.

321
00:13:32,400 --> 00:13:32,920
I don't want to hear it.

322
00:13:32,920 --> 00:13:34,380
You don't need to explain.

323
00:13:34,440 --> 00:13:34,800
Oh.

324
00:13:36,040 --> 00:13:36,560
But,

325
00:13:37,280 --> 00:13:38,840
why are you so reluctant

326
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:40,320
to do a kissing scene?

327
00:13:41,600 --> 00:13:42,560
Because

328
00:13:44,560 --> 00:13:45,040
I...

329
00:13:46,720 --> 00:13:48,850
I don't really want to kiss Bai Feixin.

330
00:13:49,160 --> 00:13:49,840
Why?

331
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:52,380
Because I want to kiss you.

332
00:13:56,280 --> 00:13:57,200
Well,

333
00:13:58,560 --> 00:13:59,800
the flowers

334
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:01,940
and the card have been delivered.

335
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,460
I'll take my leave.

336
00:14:04,080 --> 00:14:05,480
Director.

337
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:08,680
Wish you a speedy recovery.

338
00:14:08,680 --> 00:14:10,340
Come back for rehearsal soon.

339
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,680
Thank you, director.

340
00:14:20,880 --> 00:14:22,400
Thank you, King Luo.

341
00:14:22,400 --> 00:14:24,160
Thank you for taking me to see the sea.

342
00:14:24,160 --> 00:14:24,680
Guys,

343
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,160
let me tell you,

344
00:14:26,160 --> 00:14:27,680
it's getting late.

345
00:14:27,680 --> 00:14:29,760
I can only answer one last question.

346
00:14:30,960 --> 00:14:32,640
'Zai Shui Yi Fang'.

347
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:34,980
She is a long-time fan of mine.

348
00:14:35,560 --> 00:14:37,000
Let's see what she said.

349
00:14:37,720 --> 00:14:39,720
'Zai Shui Yi Fang' says,

350
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,000
"Hello, Bai Feixin.

351
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:42,560
About that thing you mentioned before,

352
00:14:42,560 --> 00:14:43,560
he confessed to me.

353
00:14:43,560 --> 00:14:45,000
I explicitly rejected him,

354
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,400
and he agreed to be just regular colleagues.

355
00:14:47,400 --> 00:14:50,080
But I feel like we can never go back to the way we were.

356
00:14:50,080 --> 00:14:51,440
At work,

357
00:14:51,440 --> 00:14:54,320
I can no longer treat him

358
00:14:54,320 --> 00:14:55,780
like a regular colleague.

359
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:58,720
I feel so awkward right now.

360
00:14:59,240 --> 00:15:01,320
I don't know what to do."

361
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:05,800
Sister Feixin is telling you very responsibly,

362
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,480
