363
00:15:08,880 --> 00:15:10,000
When it comes to love,

364
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:11,800
if you like someone, you must talk directly

365
00:15:11,800 --> 00:15:12,680
and give directly.

366
00:15:12,680 --> 00:15:14,480
Don't beat around the bush.

367
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,280
So what if the result isn't good?

368
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,320
Mr. Heying.

369
00:15:25,560 --> 00:15:26,080
Xiaoqi.

370
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:31,080
Why do I feel like you're a bit absent-minded?

371
00:15:33,800 --> 00:15:34,600
Xiaoqi.

372
00:15:35,800 --> 00:15:37,040
You really know me.

373
00:15:37,800 --> 00:15:38,800
For so many years,

374
00:15:39,600 --> 00:15:42,060
I've always felt that it's lonely at the top.

375
00:15:42,800 --> 00:15:44,730
But it wasn't until Jinxi appeared

376
00:15:44,960 --> 00:15:46,040
that I realized

377
00:15:46,960 --> 00:15:48,820
a man cannot live without a rival.

378
00:15:52,600 --> 00:15:53,400
Jinxi,

379
00:15:56,800 --> 00:15:58,000
come back.

380
00:15:59,560 --> 00:16:00,160
Ah.

381
00:16:00,360 --> 00:16:01,280
I'm exhausted.

382
00:16:01,280 --> 00:16:01,920
Ms. Qiuyu,

383
00:16:04,560 --> 00:16:05,840
the Demon King isn't here, right?

384
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,560
Ms. Qiuyu,

385
00:16:06,920 --> 00:16:08,720
the director hasn't come back from the Black Box yet?

386
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:11,250
I just bought all the new things she asked for.

387
00:16:11,560 --> 00:16:13,160
She has a new idea every day.

388
00:16:13,160 --> 00:16:14,680
I don't know why she has so many ideas.

389
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:15,240
One idea from her,

390
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,300
and I have to run my legs off, you know?

391
00:16:19,360 --> 00:16:20,480
Are you sure she's not here?

392
00:16:20,480 --> 00:16:21,080
She's not.

393
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:24,000
Since she's not here,

394
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,960
let's have some fun.

395
00:16:28,560 --> 00:16:30,160
The new version of Werewolf.

396
00:16:30,400 --> 00:16:31,440
Read it carefully.

397
00:16:31,440 --> 00:16:34,240
The rehearsal room is the best place to play games.

398
00:16:39,320 --> 00:16:40,980
How many times have I told you?

399
00:16:41,120 --> 00:16:42,360
Whether the director is here or not,

400
00:16:42,360 --> 00:16:44,080
