401
00:16:44,080 --> 00:16:45,000
That's a place for rehearsal.

402
00:16:45,000 --> 00:16:46,880
Is it a place to play with these things?

403
00:16:46,880 --> 00:16:47,480
You should rehearse when you are supposed to.

404
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,040
Got it?

405
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,450
Director, you're back.

406
00:16:51,480 --> 00:16:52,360
Have a seat.

407
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,160
I was just scolding them for you.

408
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:57,410
Even you have been corrupted by Jinxi.

409
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:58,840
Director,

410
00:16:59,800 --> 00:17:01,600
we need to balance work and rest.

411
00:17:02,240 --> 00:17:03,300
Everyone is tired.

412
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:07,280
I don't oppose balancing work and rest,

413
00:17:07,280 --> 00:17:09,119
but the schedule for 'A Chinese Ghost Story' is tight.

414
00:17:09,119 --> 00:17:10,160
Now is not the time to play.

415
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:12,000
Director, the performance is coming up soon.

416
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,280
When will Jinxi be back?

417
00:17:13,280 --> 00:17:13,960
Exactly.

418
00:17:14,280 --> 00:17:15,480
Can he make it in time?

419
00:17:16,760 --> 00:17:18,319
He said he would be back in two days.

420
00:17:18,319 --> 00:17:19,849
He'd better come back soon.

421
00:17:19,960 --> 00:17:23,020
'A Chinese Ghost Story' can't be without Ning Caichen.

422
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:24,800
Mainly, without him here,

423
00:17:24,800 --> 00:17:26,400
no one buys us milk tea.

424
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,930
No one cracks jokes either.

425
00:17:28,000 --> 00:17:30,800
And the atmosphere in the troupe is so depressing.

426
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,920
Actually,

427
00:17:37,040 --> 00:17:39,440
I don't oppose livening up the atmosphere.

428
00:17:39,600 --> 00:17:40,930
You guys can make jokes.

429
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,410
Don't hold back.

430
00:17:43,920 --> 00:17:44,780
How about this?

431
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:46,090
I'll start with one.

432
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:46,720
Ma.

433
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:50,800
What do you usually think about when you look down?

434
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:51,640
I...

435
00:17:51,640 --> 00:17:52,640
Are you wondering

436
00:17:53,360 --> 00:17:55,160
if you've gained weight lately,

437
00:17:55,560 --> 00:17:56,360
so your fat

438
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,700
can't fit into the practice clothes?

439
00:18:03,600 --> 00:18:04,730
And the three of you.

440
00:18:05,560 --> 00:18:07,400
Don't think that just because you hid in the back today,

441
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:08,760
I didn't notice you

442
00:18:09,480 --> 00:18:11,080
were all slacking off.

443
00:18:14,360 --> 00:18:15,880
Is it Mr. Qiu?

444
00:18:16,160 --> 00:18:17,760
After I finish, you tell one.

445
00:18:18,120 --> 00:18:19,480
When will Jinxi be back?

446
00:18:20,680 --> 00:18:21,400
Come on.

447
00:18:25,200 --> 00:18:25,880
Jianshe.

448
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:27,730
Is your leg feeling better?

449
00:18:29,600 --> 00:18:30,280
It's almost healed.

450
00:18:30,280 --> 00:18:32,200
I'll be able to go back in a couple of days.

451
00:18:32,200 --> 00:18:32,530
Here.

452
00:18:32,720 --> 00:18:33,360
Slow down.

453
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:36,880
Jinxi,

454
00:18:37,880 --> 00:18:39,340
I really don't understand

455
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:40,240
how you could

456
00:18:40,560 --> 00:18:43,020
injure your leg practicing a kissing scene.

457
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,400
The other day,

458
00:18:44,400 --> 00:18:45,660
I was at home by myself.

459
00:18:45,920 --> 00:18:47,440
Then I wanted to rehearse

460
00:18:47,440 --> 00:18:49,600
the scene of Ning Caichen and Nie Xiaoqian.

461
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:51,440
I wanted to find the character's state.

462
00:18:51,440 --> 00:18:53,400
I accidentally fell

463
00:18:53,400 --> 00:18:54,760
and injured my leg.

464
00:18:55,840 --> 00:18:56,240
Jin Xi.

465
00:18:56,800 --> 00:18:57,360
I think

466
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:59,740
you're just under too much pressure.

467
00:18:59,760 --> 00:19:01,560
I actually can't understand why

468
00:19:01,720 --> 00:19:04,520
you have so much pressure about the kissing scene.

469
00:19:04,760 --> 00:19:06,080
Didn't the director also say

470
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:08,480
it's not you, Jin Xi, kissing Bai Feixin,

471
00:19:08,560 --> 00:19:11,480
but Ning Caichen kissing Nie Xiaoqian?

472
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:13,400
Can you understand this?

473
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:16,500
I don't quite understand.

474
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,560
Let me put it this way, Jinxi.

475
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:23,320
As actors,

476
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:24,800
we have two selves.

477
00:19:24,800 --> 00:19:25,640
One is the id,

478
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:27,660
the other is the superego.

479
00:19:27,840 --> 00:19:28,920
As the id,

480
00:19:28,960 --> 00:19:30,240
we naturally wouldn't just casually

481
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:31,720
kiss a woman we don't love.

482
00:19:31,840 --> 00:19:32,320
Right?

483
00:19:32,560 --> 00:19:33,690
But as the superego,

484
00:19:34,040 --> 00:19:36,300
we must constantly step into character.

485
00:19:36,600 --> 00:19:38,660
If you fall in love with Nie Xiaoqian,

486
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:40,340
you have to kiss Nie Xiaoqian.

487
00:19:40,600 --> 00:19:42,000
If you fall in love with a piece of wood,

488
00:19:42,000 --> 00:19:43,600
you have to kiss that piece of wood.

489
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:45,460
If you fall in love with this land,

490
00:19:45,560 --> 00:19:47,320
you must deeply kiss this land.

491
00:19:47,840 --> 00:19:49,080
Without any distractions

492
00:19:49,080 --> 00:19:50,010
or hesitations.

493
00:19:50,640 --> 00:19:51,700
Do you understand?

494
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:52,560
Jianshe,

495
00:19:52,840 --> 00:19:54,440
sometimes I really envy you.

496
00:19:56,480 --> 00:19:59,080
I also want to be a professional actor like you.

497
00:20:00,400 --> 00:20:01,040
Jianshe,

498
00:20:01,360 --> 00:20:03,820
can you teach me how to act in a kissing scene?

499
00:20:07,600 --> 00:20:08,360
Okay.

500
00:20:13,160 --> 00:20:13,720
Jianshe,

501
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,060
I didn't mean that.

502
00:20:17,080 --> 00:20:18,940
Sorry for the misunderstanding.

503
00:20:23,280 --> 00:20:24,280
How about this.

504
00:20:24,280 --> 00:20:24,680
Right.

505
00:20:24,960 --> 00:20:25,920
That works too.

506
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:28,840
Okay then.

507
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:29,440
Jinxi,

508
00:20:29,560 --> 00:20:29,880
come here,

509
00:20:29,880 --> 00:20:30,940
and follow my lead.

510
00:20:32,560 --> 00:20:33,320
Look at it.

511
00:20:34,080 --> 00:20:36,600
Imagine it as the person you love the most.

512
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,800
Bring out all your feelings and emotions.

513
00:20:41,800 --> 00:20:42,930
Look directly at it.

514
00:20:43,600 --> 00:20:46,560
Approach it gently.

515
00:20:47,360 --> 00:20:50,840
Slowly approach it, bit by bit.

516
00:20:53,960 --> 00:20:55,360
Get close to its lips.

517
00:20:55,360 --> 00:20:56,220
Pay attention,

518
00:20:56,320 --> 00:20:58,320
it's not lips getting close to lips,

519
00:20:58,320 --> 00:21:00,320
but the touching of souls.

520
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:03,000
Get close and kiss it.

521
00:21:09,360 --> 00:21:12,020
Let it feel the strength and warmth of your lips.

522
00:21:12,120 --> 00:21:12,920
Kiss it.

523
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:15,640
Kiss it deeply.

524
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:17,840
Stroke it.

525
00:21:19,560 --> 00:21:20,280
Fall in love with it.

526
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:21,280
Kiss it.

527
00:21:45,160 --> 00:21:46,560
Why isn't he here yet?

528
00:21:47,280 --> 00:21:49,140
Welcome back, our leading actor.

529
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:50,480
Welcome.

530
00:21:51,160 --> 00:21:51,760
Director.

531
00:21:52,240 --> 00:21:53,570
My leg is all better now.

532
00:21:53,680 --> 00:21:55,280
Look, I can even do big jumps.

533
00:21:55,480 --> 00:21:55,920
Brother.

534
00:21:55,920 --> 00:21:56,760
Your legs must be numb.

535
00:21:56,760 --> 00:21:57,400
They're numb.

536
00:21:57,400 --> 00:21:58,000
Your legs must be numb.

537
00:21:58,000 --> 00:22:00,000
If you stomp, yours will go numb too.

538
00:22:00,160 --> 00:22:00,760
Director.

539
00:22:01,600 --> 00:22:03,130
Thanks to Brother Jianshe,

540
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,360
my kissing skills are now

541
00:22:04,360 --> 00:22:05,280
flawless.

542
00:22:05,280 --> 00:22:06,640
I can kiss Bai Feixin right now.

543
00:22:06,640 --> 00:22:07,320
All right.

544
00:22:07,320 --> 00:22:08,040
No need.

545
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:10,000
I believe you.

546
00:22:10,560 --> 00:22:11,800
Now that you're back,

547
00:22:11,800 --> 00:22:13,000
we are all very happy.

548
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,920
Let's rehearse then.

549
00:22:15,400 --> 00:22:16,130
Let's start.

550
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:19,400
Okay.

551
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,860
The male lead walks slowly towards our female lead.

552
00:22:25,800 --> 00:22:26,560
Good.

553
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:30,000
Keep this pace.

554
00:22:34,160 --> 00:22:34,920
And this emotion.

555
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:35,960
Very good.

556
00:22:37,200 --> 00:22:39,240
Hold it.

557
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:45,920
Approach slowly.

558
00:22:47,800 --> 00:22:49,000
Kiss.

559
00:22:50,920 --> 00:22:52,680
Kiss slowly.

560
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:58,280
So engaged.

561
00:22:59,080 --> 00:23:01,200
Very, very engaged.

562
00:23:01,200 --> 00:23:03,120
Okay, you can separate now.

563
00:23:04,280 --> 00:23:05,480
You can separate now.

564
00:23:06,560 --> 00:23:07,880
Separate now.

565
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:20,120
This is a rehearsal.

566
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,250
It's for the rehearsal.

567
00:23:26,840 --> 00:23:28,080
Such a big bouquet.

568
00:23:28,080 --> 00:23:29,000
Who sent it?

569
00:23:29,800 --> 00:23:32,320
Could it be a gift to the troupe from a partner company?

570
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:33,440
No one notified me.

571
00:23:33,800 --> 00:23:36,480
White roses are definitely for a lover.

572
00:23:37,560 --> 00:23:37,960
Right.

573
00:23:38,160 --> 00:23:39,560
You are the July wind,

574
00:23:40,000 --> 00:23:41,800
blowing hotly toward me.

575
00:23:42,560 --> 00:23:43,000
Let me see.

576
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:45,840
To accompany you through the long years.

577
00:23:46,680 --> 00:23:47,800
That's so cheesy.

578
00:23:48,160 --> 00:23:48,800
July.

579
00:23:49,320 --> 00:23:50,320
Is it for Xiao Qi?

580
00:23:50,560 --> 00:23:51,560
How is that possible?

581
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:53,360
How could anyone send them to me?

582
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,560
Then it must be from Jinxi's fans.

583
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:55,960
No.

584
00:23:56,280 --> 00:23:57,000
The ones from Jinxi's fans

585
00:23:57,000 --> 00:23:58,000
are yellow roses.

586
00:23:58,440 --> 00:23:59,300
How do you know?

587
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,760
Because I've talked with Jinxi.

588
00:24:00,760 --> 00:24:01,880
He said he likes yellow roses.

589
00:24:01,880 --> 00:24:03,140
And I like white roses.

590
00:24:03,400 --> 00:24:04,480
I even told the director last time

591
00:24:04,480 --> 00:24:06,800
that the sympathy flowers should be yellow roses.

592
00:24:06,800 --> 00:24:08,240
These are your favorite flowers?

593
00:24:08,240 --> 00:24:09,500
How come I didn't know?

594
00:24:11,560 --> 00:24:13,280
You don't like flowers and plants.

595
00:24:13,280 --> 00:24:14,560
Why would I talk to you about this?

596
00:24:14,560 --> 00:24:16,480
If you don't talk to me, you talk to someone else.

597
00:24:16,480 --> 00:24:17,760
And then have them send flowers to you?

598
00:24:17,760 --> 00:24:20,000
Zhang Wanru, do you have paranoia about being cheated on?

599
00:24:20,000 --> 00:24:22,000
Meng Tejiao, watch your mouth.

600
00:24:22,000 --> 00:24:22,760
All right.

601
00:24:22,760 --> 00:24:23,680
Stop arguing.

602
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:24,680
These flowers are for me.

603
00:24:24,680 --> 00:24:25,600
What are you arguing about?

604
00:24:25,600 --> 00:24:26,360
Why?

605
00:24:27,160 --> 00:24:29,560
Recently, people have been confessing their love to me in my livestream every day.

606
00:24:29,560 --> 00:24:30,280
My name is Bai Feixin.

607
00:24:30,280 --> 00:24:30,800
My surname is Bai.

608
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:32,260
And these are white roses.

609
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,050
What are you looking at?

610
00:24:38,360 --> 00:24:38,960
Director.

611
00:24:39,720 --> 00:24:40,280
Jinxi,

612
00:24:40,280 --> 00:24:41,210
come out with me.

613
00:24:49,400 --> 00:24:51,330
Is this the surprise you prepared?

614
00:24:51,680 --> 00:24:53,480
I've already made it very clear.

615
00:24:53,760 --> 00:24:55,420
Doing this is just pointless.

616
00:24:56,200 --> 00:24:57,080
No,

617
00:24:57,080 --> 00:24:58,360
I didn't do anything.

618
00:24:58,360 --> 00:25:00,400
And doing this won't make me happy.

619
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:03,760
I really don't know what you're talking about.

620
00:25:04,640 --> 00:25:05,440
What's wrong?

621
00:25:06,360 --> 00:25:07,000
Nothing.

622
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:10,280
Such a big bouquet of flowers.

623
00:25:10,280 --> 00:25:11,080
Whose is it?

624
00:25:11,400 --> 00:25:12,200
Why is it here?

625
00:25:13,040 --> 00:25:13,440
Mr. Wu,

626
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:14,240
your flowers.

627
00:25:14,400 --> 00:25:15,920
Did you order these flowers?

628
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,380
Who are you giving them to?

629
00:25:21,600 --> 00:25:22,960
To the investors.

630
00:25:23,200 --> 00:25:24,730
The address might be wrong.

631
00:25:25,240 --> 00:25:26,800
I thought someone was dating.

632
00:25:26,800 --> 00:25:28,260
I got excited for nothing.

633
00:25:29,360 --> 00:25:29,960
These flowers...

634
00:25:29,960 --> 00:25:30,640
They need frequent watering.

635
00:25:30,640 --> 00:25:31,640
You guys keep rehearsing.

636
00:25:31,640 --> 00:25:32,400
Keep rehearsing.

637
00:25:32,400 --> 00:25:33,400
Keep rehearsing.

638
00:25:42,000 --> 00:25:42,800
Why are you here again?

639
00:25:42,800 --> 00:25:44,060
I'm here to apologize.

640
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:46,160
These are flowers for that.

641
00:25:46,160 --> 00:25:47,480
I'll leave right after.

642
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:48,140
Apologize?

643
00:25:48,560 --> 00:25:49,880
What are you apologizing for?

644
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:51,120
It's because of me.

645
00:25:51,360 --> 00:25:53,690
I've been pressuring you too much lately.

646
00:25:53,720 --> 00:25:56,680
That's why you thought I sent the flowers to the rehearsal room.

647
00:25:56,680 --> 00:25:57,210
Besides,

648
00:25:58,080 --> 00:26:00,320
since we've spent so much time together,

649
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:02,320
I want to apologize for everything.

650
00:26:04,080 --> 00:26:04,680
I'm sorry.

651
00:26:08,480 --> 00:26:09,880
I was the one in the wrong.

652
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:12,280
But,

653
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:13,440
you knew

654
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,970
I was mad about the flowers,

655
00:26:15,160 --> 00:26:17,620
and you still brought flowers to apologize.

656
00:26:18,040 --> 00:26:18,640
Yeah.

657
00:26:18,640 --> 00:26:20,040
I crossed the line.

658
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:22,440
Come in.

659
00:26:32,200 --> 00:26:32,860
Take a seat.

660
00:26:35,280 --> 00:26:36,610
Thanks for the flowers.

661
00:26:37,120 --> 00:26:38,520
I had a bad attitude then.

662
00:26:39,400 --> 00:26:41,260
As long as you're not mad anymore.

663
00:26:42,320 --> 00:26:43,920
I didn't figure out the truth

664
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,580
and just lost my temper at you.

665
00:26:46,400 --> 00:26:47,120
Actually,

666
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:50,330
I couldn't sleep after I came back.

667
00:26:51,880 --> 00:26:53,480
I wanted to apologize to you,

668
00:26:54,320 --> 00:26:56,380
but I couldn't bring myself to say it.

669
00:26:56,720 --> 00:26:58,560
So I numbed myself with work.

670
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:01,450
But I ended up writing nothing.

671
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:02,960
I don't know

672
00:27:02,960 --> 00:27:04,960
what I've been so nervous about lately.

673
00:27:04,960 --> 00:27:06,420
What song are you writing?

674
00:27:06,560 --> 00:27:07,760
It's very important.

675
00:27:07,840 --> 00:27:11,000
The song of Nie Xiaoqian and Ning Caichen's first meeting.

676
00:27:11,000 --> 00:27:12,460
But I've been out of ideas.

677
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:15,000
You're stuck.

678
00:27:16,680 --> 00:27:18,920
I often get stuck when writing songs too.

679
00:27:18,920 --> 00:27:19,920
So I've figured out

680
00:27:19,920 --> 00:27:22,050
over 10,000 ways to find inspiration.

681
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:23,840
Want to try?
